# Code owners.
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owner of every path a pull request touches.
# The last pattern that matches a file wins, so the specific entries below
# override the catch-all at the top.
#
# @mcpd/maintainers is the maintainers team in the mcpd organisation. GitHub
# silently ignores an owner it cannot resolve, which turns this file into
# decoration, so if that team is renamed, change it here in the same commit.
# MAINTAINERS.md says what each area below is reviewed for.

# Everything, unless something more specific claims it.
*                                   @mcpd/maintainers

# The single source of truth, and the generator that propagates it. A change
# here is reproduced into every language and every generated document at once,
# and a field name shipped by mistake is close to permanent.
/spec/                              @mcpd/maintainers
/tools/                             @mcpd/maintainers

# The contract that binds every SDK. Behaviours B1 to B10 hold in all of them
# or in none of them, so this file changes before any SDK does.
/sdks/SDK-CONTRACT.md               @mcpd/maintainers

# The daemon. Anything reachable from the network, plus the storage backends
# and the redaction pipeline that runs before a prompt is written to disk.
/crates/                            @mcpd/maintainers

# What ships to operators. A manifest that names a flag the binary does not
# have breaks a deployment, not a build.
/deploy/                            @mcpd/maintainers
/Dockerfile                         @mcpd/maintainers

# CI is what proves the rest of this file's claims. A change to it can make
# every other check stop meaning anything.
/.github/                           @mcpd/maintainers
/Makefile                           @mcpd/maintainers

# Licensing and governance. Only the copyright holder changes these.
/LICENSE                            @mcpd/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTOR_LICENSE_AGREEMENT.md   @mcpd/maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                 @mcpd/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                        @mcpd/maintainers
/MAINTAINERS.md                     @mcpd/maintainers
